{"number":17,"title":"Replace placeholder extension icons with real branding","body":"The extension currently ships the generated placeholder icons (a white &#34;T&#34; monogram on a blue square, `client/icons/icon{16,32,48,128}.png`, from `client/scripts/gen-icons.mjs`). They&#39;re valid and presentable enough for v1, but should be replaced with real branding.

**To close:** drop real 16/32/48/128px PNGs into `client/icons/` (same filenames the manifest references), commit, and ship them in a version bump. No code change needed — they&#39;re committed files packaged as-is.

